      "hizbQuarter": 133,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2613,
      "text": "Do you not see that to Allah prostrate[10] all those who are in the heavens and all those on earth: the sun, the moon, the stars, the mountains, the trees, the moving creatures, and many humans? But there are many to whom the punishment has become due[11]. Whoever Allah disgraces, none can honor him. Allah surely does what He wills.",
      "surah": {
